{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01LFcbxcg5CS77xTMHTgq1tK", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://journal.unm.ac.id/index.php/PJAHSS/article/download/1584/991/4546\"}, {\"url\": \"https://journal.unm.ac.id/index.php/PJAHSS/article/view/1584\"}, {\"url\": \"https://jurnal.untirta.ac.id/index.php/JPKS/article/download/11268/7408\"}, {\"url\": \"https://eprints.unm.ac.id/7514/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ejurnal.uibu.ac.id/index.php/maharsi/article/download/2558/1762/8742\"}, {\"url\": \"https://archives.crem-cnrs.fr/archives/items/CNRSMH_I_2005_013_001_86/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://archives.crem-cnrs.fr/archives/items/CNRSMH_I_2005_013_001_862/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://archives.crem-cnrs.fr/archives/items/CNRSMH_I_2005_013_001_861/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://lobo.journals.yorku.ca/index.php/default/article/download/103/113/169\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:17:15.726Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "tarian Ma'bua Toraja hanya diadakan 12 tahun sekali", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01JJo6tMidRcqhU1BvKRmnjt", "content": [{"title": "journal.unm.ac.id", "url": "https://journal.unm.ac.id/index.php/PJAHSS/article/download/1584/991/4546"}, {"title": "Revitalization of Moral Values in Pa'Gellu Toraja Culture", "url": "https://journal.unm.ac.id/index.php/PJAHSS/article/view/1584"}, {"title": "untirta.ac.id", "url": "https://jurnal.untirta.ac.id/index.php/JPKS/article/download/11268/7408"}, {"title": "eprints.unm.ac.id", "url": "https://eprints.unm.ac.id/7514/"}, {"title": "ejurnal.uibu.ac.id", "url": "https://ejurnal.uibu.ac.id/index.php/maharsi/article/download/2558/1762/8742"}, {"title": "Item : (RENCONTRES CULTURELLES) MUSIQUES TORAJA PENDANT UN FESTIVAL", "url": "https://archives.crem-cnrs.fr/archives/items/CNRSMH_I_2005_013_001_86/"}, {"title": "Item : (RENCONTRES CULTURELLES) MUSIQUES TORAJA PENDANT UN FESTIVAL (fin)", "url": "https://archives.crem-cnrs.fr/archives/items/CNRSMH_I_2005_013_001_862/"}, {"title": "Item : (RENCONTRES CULTURELLES) MUSIQUES TORAJA PENDANT UN FESTIVAL (suite)", "url": "https://archives.crem-cnrs.fr/archives/items/CNRSMH_I_2005_013_001_861/"}, {"title": "yorku.ca", "url": "https://lobo.journals.yorku.ca/index.php/default/article/download/103/113/169"}]}, "Hasil pencarian tidak mendukung klaim bahwa tarian Ma'bua hanya diadakan 12 tahun sekali. Tidak ada sumber yang menyebut interval waktu tersebut.\n\nYang ditemukan:\n- Dalam beberapa jurnal, Ma'bua disebut sebagai upacara peresmian rumah Tongkonan. Tarian yang sering tampil dalam upacara itu adalah Pa'gellu', bersama upacara Rambu Tuka', penyambutan tamu, dan pesta pernikahan (Pa'gellu' is a traditional dance of the Toraja community often performed during rambu tuka ceremonies (celebration ceremonies), welcoming guests, wedding parties, and ma'bua).\n- Sumber ini juga menyebut bahwa Pa'gellu' berakar pada penyambutan pahlawan yang pulang dari perang (originating from Ne'lekke as a form of welcoming heroes returning from wars).\n- Sebuah studi tentang Tari Manimbong menyatakan bahwa tarian itu hanya boleh dibawakan dalam upacara Rambu Tuka' (hanya boleh dilaksanakan pada upacara adat rambu tuka' saja). Ini tentang tarian lain, bukan Ma'bua.\n\nSaran: klaim 12 tahun perlu diverifikasi melalui sumber budaya Toraja, dinas pariwisata Tana Toraja atau Toraja Utara, atau penelitian etnografi tentang Ma'bua secara khusus. Pencarian berikutnya bisa diarahkan ke kata kunci \"Ma'bua Tongkonan siklus\" atau \"Ma'bua Toraja frekuensi upacara\"."], "durationSeconds": 6.646810915999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01LFcbxcg5CS77xTMHTgq1tK", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
